| !Boot file for !GameLib, the library of JavaScript modules that
| games import as 'gamelib/<Name>'. The desktop runs it at
| start-up, as it does every application in !Boot.Resources, so the
| library is known before any game needs it.
| A setting made before this runs is kept: set GameLib$Dir (or
| GameLib$Path) first to use another copy of the library.
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
If "<GameLib$Dir>" = "" Then Set GameLib$Dir <Obey$Dir>
If "<GameLib$Path>" = "" Then Set GameLib$Path <GameLib$Dir>.
Set GameLib$Version 1.00
